~ start
% Queso: Ugh, finally made it, I'm exhausted...
% Queso: Hey! You! Potion maker!
% Queso: Phew, had a rough day of work today.

match Globals.wantedPotionType: # this is a placeholder while we set up a global variable for the wanted potions
	when "MogFace":
		Queso: Chat keeps saying I'm ugly, make me look confident!
	when "Beautification":
		Queso: I'm gonna see if I can get a date tonight, make me attractive!
	when "ShakeRapidly":
		Queso: I've got so much stress on me, I need to shake it out!
	when "EyeColourSwap":
		Queso: I'm gonna prank my chat, change my eye colour!
	when "PermanentSmile":
		Queso: People always say I have a bad resting face, fix it!
	when "GreenSkin":
		Queso: Change my hue!
	when "Cure":
		Queso: I got too excited and ate chicken that was too raw, cure me!
	when "Bald":
		Queso: I'm done with having hair. Get rid of it!
	when "HeadSizeIncrease":
		Queso: I hate people saying I look like a Laygo brick, my head is too small for my body!
		# "laygo" to be an off-brand lego
	when "HeadSizeDecrease":
		Queso: I'm leaning into the bit now! Make my head like a little bump!
	when "CreatureFeature":
		Queso: People keep coming up to me on the street asking for pictures, make me into a different creature!
	when "Rabies": #look idk what to put here, why would someone want this?
		Queso: ...
	when "ChangeLanguage":
		Queso: I'm abouta do a collab stream, but I don't speak their language!
	when "ChangeArtStyle":
		Queso: I want to get some fan art, but make it real!
	when "SwapBodies": #not sure what this one is about
		Queso: People keep coming up to me on the street asking for pictures, make me into a different person!
	when "Love":
		Queso: I'm gonna see if I can get a date tonight, make me lovable!
	when "Explode":
		Queso: Help my channel blow up!
	when "Skeleton":
		Queso: I'm gonna scare my chat today! Make me spooky!
	when "EnlargePerson":
		Queso: They keep saying I'm obese, show them how big I can be!
	when "ShrinkPerson":
		Queso: They keep saying I'm obese, make me small!
	else:
		Queso: I dont even know what I want! Just give me something to drink! (placeholder: no requested potion set)

- Confirm

=> END